<p class="lead">Mathews bow packages take one of the most respected compound bows on the market and turn it into a complete, ready-to-shoot setup. Instead of buying a bare bow and hunting down a sight, rest, quiver and stabilizer on your own, a Mathews compound bow package bundles the essentials and, at a good shop, includes the setup work that makes them shoot well together.</p>

<p>This guide explains what a Mathews package usually includes, how a Mathews RTH package compares with buying a bare bow, how Mathews cams and limbs affect the way a bow shoots, and which archers get the most out of a package. Whether you are shopping for your first Mathews bow or replacing an older one, you will know what to ask the dealer before you hand over a card.</p>

