<h2 id="h-final-thoughts">Final Thoughts</h2>
<p>Mathews bow packages make sense for most shooters who want a premium bow without the hassle of building a setup from scratch. Get measured, decide how you will hunt, then ask the dealer exactly what the package includes and what setup work comes with it. A well-assembled Mathews RTH package can carry you from your first practice session to your first hunt with very little else to buy.</p>

